      "impact": "harm",
      "reasoning": "Independent translations visibly diverge on core action naming and argument schemas: getObjects/find, send/send_follow_up, find_motherboard/find, prepare/get_cup_ready, explain/request, say/hello, and numerous incompatible attribute names. Since all undefined calls are valid Actions, the language supplies no canonical vocabulary, ontology, or normalization rule that would make those alternatives equivalent rather than merely similar. The call-site task/action resolution also makes an otherwise identical call change meaning when a task definition exists elsewhere in scope."
    },
