This is Sprint 0 (bootstrap): the language has no constructs yet. Propose an initial syntax **basis** — a small set of foundational, composable constructs (aim for 3-6, every change `op: "add"`, change_type MAJOR) that together can express simple agent-requests, drawing structural inspiration from: python, html, english. Prefer a small orthogonal core over redundant coverage — every later sprint composes from these.

